{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dopamine-boosting gameplay loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catching fish is only the beginning.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line and hunt for the perfect catch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale fish, but be careful not to damage it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your haul and invest into upgrades</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go deeper to catch bigger, stranger fish</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each upgrade pushes you further into the depths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/2fd23d9ea2280d3a66fa167f115deba0.poster.avif?t=1773396398\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/2fd23d9ea2280d3a66fa167f115deba0.webm?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/2fd23d9ea2280d3a66fa167f115deba0.mp4?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various locations, plenty of surprises</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore distinct locations, each inspired by real sites and built with its own:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environment and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish species</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map hides surprises, from secret spots to puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/19011883d29f0c274c1bfa5d7f3278b0.poster.avif?t=1773396398\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/19011883d29f0c274c1bfa5d7f3278b0.webm?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/19011883d29f0c274c1bfa5d7f3278b0.mp4?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unexpected customers with individual tastes (and opinions)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your customers aren\u2019t human. Feed legendary creatures like Nessie and Kelpie along with other unexpected visitors, often pulled straight from myth and folklore.<br>Each customer has their own personality, and they prefer specific types of fish. Learning who likes what, and serving the <i>right</i> fish to the <i>right</i> customer is a great way to make your pockets deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/924de179c8ddaf854c3036ff4477cfa9.poster.avif?t=1773396398\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/924de179c8ddaf854c3036ff4477cfa9.webm?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/924de179c8ddaf854c3036ff4477cfa9.mp4?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secrets &amp; treasures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just fish out there. The depths reward curiosity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden treasures and collectible artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Messages in bottles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles and levers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If something looks suspicious, it probably is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/ccfdca8437a07aa3327dbd5ad780bc23.poster.avif?t=1773396398\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/ccfdca8437a07aa3327dbd5ad780bc23.webm?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/ccfdca8437a07aa3327dbd5ad780bc23.mp4?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your boat &amp; fish in style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress isn\u2019t just about numbers.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your fishing gear: longer lines, better bait, deeper dives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your boat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cosmetics for your character</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because exploring the depths (and feeding ancient beings) should be done <i>in style.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/f96b940e1eb7137691b748479db43159.poster.avif?t=1773396398\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/f96b940e1eb7137691b748479db43159.webm?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/f96b940e1eb7137691b748479db43159.mp4?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3198890?t=1773396398","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/d2211a559f83c5db2cce57507a812641c1021fcf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773396398","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/a995e1d1cff0a50782cdb928facd6fb8233123eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773396398","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/a995e1d1cff0a50782cdb928facd6fb8233123eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773396398","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3821770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>About the developers</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re Glass Gecko Games, a small indie team from Canada. Scale the Depths began as a game jam project and grew into a fully independent game. And in case you\u2019ve seen \u201csimilar\u201d mobile ads floating around\u2026 this is the original \ud83d\ude09</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dopamine-boosting gameplay loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catching fish is only the beginning.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line and hunt for the perfect catch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale fish, but be careful not to damage it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your haul and invest into upgrades</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go deeper to catch bigger, stranger fish</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each upgrade pushes you further into the depths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/2fd23d9ea2280d3a66fa167f115deba0.poster.avif?t=1773396398\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/2fd23d9ea2280d3a66fa167f115deba0.webm?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/2fd23d9ea2280d3a66fa167f115deba0.mp4?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various locations, plenty of surprises</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore distinct locations, each inspired by real sites and built with its own:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environment and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish species</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map hides surprises, from secret spots to puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/19011883d29f0c274c1bfa5d7f3278b0.poster.avif?t=1773396398\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/19011883d29f0c274c1bfa5d7f3278b0.webm?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/19011883d29f0c274c1bfa5d7f3278b0.mp4?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unexpected customers with individual tastes (and opinions)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your customers aren\u2019t human. Feed legendary creatures like Nessie and Kelpie along with other unexpected visitors, often pulled straight from myth and folklore.<br>Each customer has their own personality, and they prefer specific types of fish. Learning who likes what, and serving the <i>right</i> fish to the <i>right</i> customer is a great way to make your pockets deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/924de179c8ddaf854c3036ff4477cfa9.poster.avif?t=1773396398\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/924de179c8ddaf854c3036ff4477cfa9.webm?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/924de179c8ddaf854c3036ff4477cfa9.mp4?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secrets &amp; treasures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just fish out there. The depths reward curiosity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden treasures and collectible artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Messages in bottles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles and levers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If something looks suspicious, it probably is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/ccfdca8437a07aa3327dbd5ad780bc23.poster.avif?t=1773396398\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/ccfdca8437a07aa3327dbd5ad780bc23.webm?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/ccfdca8437a07aa3327dbd5ad780bc23.mp4?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your boat &amp; fish in style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress isn\u2019t just about numbers.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your fishing gear: longer lines, better bait, deeper dives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your boat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cosmetics for your character</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because exploring the depths (and feeding ancient beings) should be done <i>in style.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/f96b940e1eb7137691b748479db43159.poster.avif?t=1773396398\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/f96b940e1eb7137691b748479db43159.webm?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/f96b940e1eb7137691b748479db43159.mp4?t=1773396398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Glass Gecko Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/eef9d7cb8fba1483b79c30fd83e6fb6a83d85d6b/header.jpg?t=1773396398","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3198890/1016546214/56a0d1ba62c82b89efca01e6582ba5368d4ca0f3/1750346526/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750348023","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3198890/1016546214/56a0d1ba62c82b89efca01e6582ba5368d4ca0f3/1750346526/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750348023","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3198890/1016546214/56a0d1ba62c82b89efca01e6582ba5368d